Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: dotnet-runtime-10.0, himmelblau-broker, iproute2, adduser, python3
Recommends: himmelblau, himmelblau-sso
Homepage: https://github.com/berg-itfi/GSA4Linux
Description: Unofficial Linux client for Microsoft Entra Global Secure Access
 Connects an Entra-joined Linux machine to Microsoft Global Secure Access
 (Private Access and the M365 traffic-forwarding profile) using the
 microsoft.ztna.v2 tunnel protocol. Authentication is delegated to the
 himmelblau identity broker, which holds the device's Entra PRT.
 .
 Installs a non-root system daemon (gsa4linuxd) plus a per-user session token
 agent and a StatusNotifierItem tray applet. Intelligent Local Access is driven
 entirely by the tenant policy GSA pushes.
